<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-797] IllegalArgumentException when calling CodahaleOpStatsLogger#toOpStatsData()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-797</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The implementation of CodahaleOpStatsLogger#toOpStatsData() passes incorrect parameters to codahale&apos;s Snapshot#getValue method, resulting in the following runtime exception:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: 10.0 is not in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0..1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
	at com.codahale.metrics.Snapshot.getValue(Snapshot.java:52)&lt;br/&gt;
	at org.apache.bookkeeper.stats.CodahaleOpStatsLogger.toOpStatsData(CodahaleOpStatsLogger.java:64)&lt;br/&gt;
...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In order to pass quantiles as &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0..1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; values, as expected by codahale metrics library, we must divide parameters by 100 before passing them.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12756403">BOOKKEEPER-797</key>
